Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, you're prickly!
